<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hypobank, Deutsche Bank, DG Bank, Commerzbank and Caisse des Depots et Cosignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    10.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.235    PAY DATE  S-23.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.215     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE 34</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
